    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "9 Highfield is a fabulous unfurnished three-bedroom semi-detached home with large garden to the rear, located in a cul-de-sac of 10 homes in the centre of Carnew town directly adjacent to the national school and secondary school and adjoining \"Candys\" shop and petrol station. \r\n\r\nAccommodation comprises of a spacious sitting room with wooden floors and a feature open fireplace. The sitting room is connected to the Dining and Kitchen area via double doors that allow extra light into the room and also has a patio door to the back garden. A guest WC completes the accommodation on the groundfloor. Upstairs there are three bedrooms with the master bedroom enjoying its own ensuite with an electric shower and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nCarnew is within easy commuting distance of Dublin, situated in south County Wicklow approximately ten minutes drive from Gorey town."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 4.90m x 1.80m\r\n\r\n\r\nLounge - 4.9m x 3.76m\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/Diningroom - 5.66m x 3.4m\r\nat widest point.\r\n\r\nW.C. - 1.4m x 1.4m\r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.5m x 2.25m\r\n\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 3.31m x 3.50m\r\n\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.60m x 1.00m\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Two - 2.76m x 3.70m\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom Three - 2.80m x 2.60m\r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.40m x 2.25m\r\nat widest point."
      },
